{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22174","headline":"东坡秋意寄元八 · 白居易","name":"东坡秋意寄元八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥落野陂畔，独行思有余。\n秋荷病叶上，白露大如珠。\n忽忆同赏地，曲江东北隅。\n秋池少游客，唯我与君俱。\n啼蛩隐红蓼，瘦马蹋青芜。\n当时与今日，俱是暮秋初。\n节物苦相似，时景亦无余。\n唯有人分散，经年不得书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}